 "title": "Factory Hum",
 "category": "Pads and atmospheres",
 "text": "Sound: an electrical, mechanical drone: the hum and buzz of machinery in a dark industrial space, pulsing slowly.\n\nHow it's built: a low pulse and pink noise through the Crusher (a few bits: grit and buzz), then a band-pass; an LFO's 0..1 output into the VCA's CV with its LEVEL half up makes the slow throb; a Delay and a big Reverb. The envelope fades it in and out. Two voices.\n\nPlay: hold one or two low notes.\n\nTweak: the LFO's RATE (the throb), BITS, the filter's CUTOFF, the noise level.",
